cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, the potential energy surface or the data, please cite the article below."
title: "CO-CO2 full-dimensional (9D) potential energy surface"
abstract: >-
  9-dimensional potential energy surface for the CO2-CO van der Waals complex,
  fitted with fundamental-invariant neural networks (FINN) to 65 330
  counterpoise-corrected CCSD(T)-F12a/aug-cc-pVTZ ab initio points, together
  with the Fortran evaluation routines, network weights, the full ab initio
  data set and a Molpro example.
